<div>
  <h2>The Solution</h2>

  <div class="side-by-side">
    <p class="big">Motion Direction</p>
    <p>
      I led animation direction and motion design for an event package that
      combined Porsche's branding with Rocket League's fast action.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="side-by-side">
    <p class="big">Real-Time Broadcast Overlays</p>
    <p>
      We developed a real-time, API-driven overlay system that puts tournament
      data into the live broadcast.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="side-by-side">
    <p class="big">Announcement Trailer</p>
    <p>
      I directed the tournament trailer, which features the Porsche 911 Turbo as
      the centerpiece of the event.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div>
  <h2>The Impact</h2>
  <p>
    The tournament drew 1.23M total views, 47.9K peak concurrent viewers, and 800K+ social impressions, making it one of Rocket League's biggest events of
    2023. Fourteen of the top 15 Rocket League streams on Twitch featured it.
  </p>
</div>

